0/extras/df3ac3625d3e93e621d18d077c5ee63e.mp4?t=1769467812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br> <br><strong>Manage New Shelves and Store Layout</strong> <br>Add new shelves, optimize your store layout, and display your products in the most efficient way. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957480/extras/6ed6ea33b436cc86003e197a5413f7bb.poster.avif?t=1769467812\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957480/extras/6ed6ea33b436cc86003e197a5413f7bb.webm?t=1769467812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957480/extras/6ed6ea33b436cc86003e197a5413f7bb.mp4?t=1769467812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Expand and Customize Your Store</strong><br>Use your earnings to expand your shop, customize the interior, and change the ceiling, walls, and floor colors. Shape your store to match your style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957480/extras/f91f51393d40c8614b03fc676c900745.poster.avif?t=1769467812\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957480/extras/f91f51393d40c8614b03fc676c900745.webm?t=1769467812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957480/extras/f91f51393d40c8614b03fc676c900745.mp4?t=1769467812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Additional Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐎 <strong>Courier Wagon</strong><br>Automatically delivers orders during the day and provides you with passive income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤠 <strong>Gunslinger</strong><br>Protects your store from thieves, helping you run your business safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📢 <strong>Advertisement Package</strong><br>Invest in more customers! When purchased, it brings <strong>+2 customers per minute</strong> to your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Inflation (Random Event)</strong><br>May activate when a new day begins. If it does, product prices change due to inflation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤠🔥 <strong>Cowboy Madness (Random Event)</strong><br>May activate when a new day begins. If it does, your store will experience a <strong>Black Friday-style customer rush!</strong>🃏 <strong>Card Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 cards on the table, one of them is a Joker. If you find the Joker, you win the bet; if not, you lose.</p>",
